{"_id":"6a2ff0302204ffbc59e5a3f2","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"qiUPTXFgfukxlPhnv76jo","description":"# Arrays & ndarray\n\nThe `ndarray` is NumPy's core data structure: a multi-dimensional, homogeneously typed array stored in contiguous memory. It supports element-wise operations, broadcasting, and vectorized computation far faster than Python lists. Understanding ndarray is fundamental to working efficiently with numerical data in Python.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"NumPy: the absolute basics for beginners","url":"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/user/absolute_beginners.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aec0d"},{"type":"official","title":"numpy.array","url":"https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/generated/numpy.array.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aec0e"},{"type":"video","title":"Ultimate Guide to NumPy Arrays","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lLRBYKwP8GQ&pp=ygUMbnVtcHkgYXJyYXlz","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aec0f"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:29:36.130Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/qiUPTXFgfukxlPhnv76jo.md"}